 # If they ask "Why did you remove the proxy repository?"

 This is an important question.

 Say:

 > "We removed it as an immediate mitigation because the logs showed that the proxy repository was causing the HTTP 500 errors. The goal was to isolate the problematic component and restore application builds quickly. It was a workaround, not the permanent RCA. We then worked with Nexus Support to identify why the repository was returning invalid content."

 That shows you understand the difference between **mitigation and permanent resolution**.

